invariant: INV-4
file: rand_draw.h
catches: quic_loop_session
reason: rand_draw hands the session's rand_bytes a NULL context instead of
  the session's rand_io. A source that keeps its state behind rand_io, as
  every source with a stream per session does, cannot tell one session
  from another, so two sessions would draw from one stream or from none.
  The session loop's callback counts each draw against the source its
  rand_io names, and a draw that names none is a stray.

--- old
    cfg->rand_bytes(cfg->rand_io, p, n);
--- new
    cfg->rand_bytes(NULL, p, n);
